@startuml
title Receiving a Webmention (asynchronous)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Linking site" as Sender
participant "WebmentionEndpoint\n/webmention" as Endpoint
queue "Message queue\n(doctrine)" as Queue
participant "Worker\nReceiveWebmentionHandler" as Worker
participant "MentionReceiver" as Receiver
participant "Linking page\n(source)" as Source
database "tx_pongback_\ndomain_model_pingback" as Table

Sender -> Endpoint : POST source, target\n(form encoded)
Endpoint -> Endpoint : http(s) URLs, different,\nrate limit per IP,\ntarget is a visible page of this site
alt invalid
  Endpoint --> Sender : 400 Bad Request / 429 Too Many Requests
else valid
  Endpoint -> Queue : ReceiveWebmentionMessage
  Endpoint --> Sender : 202 Accepted
end

== Later: messenger:consume doctrine ==

Queue -> Worker : ReceiveWebmentionMessage
Worker -> Receiver : synchronize(mention, site)
Receiver -> Source : GET source
alt source links to target
  Source --> Receiver : HTML
  Receiver -> Table : new: store (events, email as for Pingbacks)\nknown: update title and excerpt
else source gone (404/410) or no longer linking
  Receiver -> Table : remove a stored mention
else network or server problem
  Receiver --> Worker : temporary problem
  Worker -> Queue : again in 5 minutes, then in 1 hour
end

note over Sender, Endpoint
  The linking site only gets 202 Accepted.
  The result of the verification is not reported back.
end note
@enduml
